This is exactly why many competent players kick in doors.  Low DEX is
a much bigger problem than having no door to hide behind.  If you keep
your pet and/or a ranged weapon, nymphs and leps aren't as big a deal
as failing to hit something that is pounding you away from a door,
like in the mines.  Don't be burdened.

You get a guaranteed stat-check at turn 600, and its a no-brainer to
exercise as much as possible.  Kick doors and fight for DEX.  Break
and open ("The door resists") doors for STR.  You won't always have
keys or boulders.  You can kick thru DL1 with impunity, check for
shops below that.  If you're lucky you will get both a STR and DEX
boost early, and have another chance 600-1000 turns later.

